This fork is based on libfprint 1.94.7 (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

SIFT feature extraction and the rigid-placement matcher in
libfprint/drivers/elanpress-sift.c, elanpress-sift.h,
libfprint/drivers/elanpress-match.c and elanpress-match.h are derived
from the elanpress driver in filip-rs/libfprint:

  Copyright (C) 2026 Filip Spanne
  SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later

The custom image matcher API in libfprint/fpi-image-device.[ch] and
libfprint/fpi-print.c is inspired by the libfprint-elan-0c28-patch
(AUR) experimental package.

Device-specific changes for ELAN 04f3:0c1a (pre-scan polling,
calibration wait, press capture, threshold 9) were made for this fork.
